(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: SLB9673 TPM 2.0, the keystore's hardware key holder (BRD-059, should; OS-032);\n   mainline tpm_tis_i2c (DKMS on Debian).\n2. Absent state: unfitted: 0x2E free; reset pulled to its inactive level; PIRQ pulled up.\n3. Always on (vcca1v8_pmu, G5). TEST# held high; GPIO_00-02, NC and NCI open (DS Table 4).\n4. VDD from vcca1v8_pmu through link #20, 0.1 Ω (power tree §4.12: 30 mA est., 3 mV)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 144.78 0) (size 129.54 16.51) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "93692024-e2c7-5761-a8b9-151e8389a1c0"))
